<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20541] FLR-EC: lfs support to migrate a stripe to a different OST</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20541</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;lfs support to migrate a stripe to a different OST.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This will be useful for replacing a bad stripe for the data component in an EC protected file using degraded read.&lt;br/&gt;
For migrating away from an OST/rack/failure domain before a scheduled maintenance event&lt;br/&gt;
For re-balancing of OST usage&lt;br/&gt;
...&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We do not yet support migration of parity stripes.  That will come later as a separate feature once we decide how that should work.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
